   "beat": 17,
   "text": "Then one doubt hits."
  },
  {
   "beat": 20.5,
   "text": "And it falls over. Again."
  },
  {
   "beat": 23.6,
   "text": "Belief isn't argued into you."
  },
  {
   "beat": 27,
   "text": "So how do you drive it in?"
  },
  {
   "beat": 31,
   "text": "One. Write it down."
  },
  {
