   "text": "Not I'll try. I do.",
   "speed": 1.15
  },
  {
   "beat": 52,
   "text": "Not someday. Today.",
   "speed": 1.15
  },
  {
   "beat": 54.5,
   "text": "Not I hope. I will.",
   "speed": 1.15
  },
  {
   "beat": 57.5,
   "text": "Two strikes is the floor."
  },
  {
   "beat": 60.5,
   "text": "Not the ceiling."
  },
  {
   "beat": 62.5,
   "text": "Flood your mind with it."
  },
  {
   "beat": 67,
   "text": "Belief isn't argued into you. It's trained.",
   "speed": 1.1
  },
  {
   "beat": 72,
   "text": "Strike it twice. Every day."
  },
  {
   "beat": 75.5,
